!.env.example
# Selected research evidence and dependencies of the submitted offline tests.
# Unselected historical runs and new ad hoc artifact directories stay local.
/artifacts/*
!/artifacts/README.md
!/artifacts/arxiv-concepts-20261031/
!/artifacts/arxiv-keybert-20261101/
!/artifacts/keybert-experiment-20261101/
!/artifacts/openaire-experiment-20261101/
!/artifacts/integration-readiness-20261101/
!/artifacts/readiness-live-results-20261101/
!/artifacts/depth-approved-run/
!/artifacts/fallback-approved-run/
# Earlier reports/data are referenced by retained documentation.
!/artifacts/query-evaluation-20261030/
!/artifacts/provider-diagnostics-20261030/
!/artifacts/provider-diagnostics-followup-20261030/
# Older raw diagnostics are not needed for the final routing/depth analysis.
/artifacts/query-evaluation-20261030/responses/
/artifacts/provider-diagnostics-20261030/responses/
/artifacts/provider-diagnostics-followup-20261030/responses/
# Preserve the actual KeyBERT run, not its unrun intermediate query drafts.
/artifacts/keybert-experiment-20261101/queries_initial.json
/artifacts/keybert-experiment-20261101/queries_candidate_fix.json
/artifacts/keybert-experiment-20261101/query_review_initial.md
/artifacts/keybert-experiment-20261101/query_review_candidate_fix.md
# Label-source mapping and manual checks are needed by the readiness tests.
# Unrun Gemini judgments/metrics and its database remain local.
!/artifacts/gemini-relevance-20261031/
/artifacts/gemini-relevance-20261031/*
!/artifacts/gemini-relevance-20261031/manifest.json
!/artifacts/gemini-relevance-20261031/manual_validation_30.csv
!/artifacts/gemini-relevance-20261031/manual_validation_30_filled.csv
!/artifacts/gemini-relevance-20261031/prompt.txt
# Already excluded by /artifacts/*; explicit for clarity and future edits.
/artifacts/local-models/
/artifacts/runtime/
/outputs/
